02x.png","line":25,"embedded":true},{"title":"An illustration of Apple Pencil drawing a curved line that increases in thickness as more pressure is applied to the tool.","target":"https://docs-assets.developer.apple.com/published/ce6370f2a90cf23b39ee77f7ba64ff02/apple-pencil-pressure%402x.png","line":27,"embedded":true},{"title":"An illustration of Apple Pencil balancing on its tip at the center of a circle that has degree marks around its circumference. A line from the center of the circle to one of the degree marks indicates the angle at which Apple Pencil is tilted.","target":"https://docs-assets.developer.apple.com/published/e3cd83ae350aac7fe4886903d65ac495/apple-pencil-azimuth%402x.png","line":29,"embedded":true},{"title":"An illustration of an iPad app that shows a stack of three circular controls on both side edges. A drawing of a person’s left hand holding an Apple Pencil is shown at the bottom-left corner of the screen, partially obscuring the controls on that side. The controls on the left edge are grayed out to indicate the original position they no longer occupy, while the controls on the right edge are bright to indicate their final position.","target":"https://docs-assets.developer.apple.com/published/386201ad5a8d093d8c72fc4db57978aa/apple-pencil-controls-moved-right%402x.png","line":35,"embedded":true},{"title":"An illustration of an iPad app that shows a stack of three circular controls on both side edges. A drawing of a person’s right hand holding an Apple Pencil is shown at the bottom-right corner of the screen, partially obscuring the controls on that side. The controls on the right edge are grayed out to indicate the original position they no longer occupy, while the controls on the left edge are bright to indicate their final position.","target":"https://docs-assets.developer.apple.com/published/6b9182644f4624493d4fbe541186a4dc/apple-pencil-controls-moved-left%402x.png","line":37,"embedded":true},{"title":"Hover","target":"https://developer.apple.com/design/human-interface-guidelines/apple-pencil-and-scribble#Hover","line":39},{"title":"An illustration of Apple Pencil hovering slightly above a gray rectangle that represents the screen. A small blue oval beneath the tip represents a preview.","target":"https://docs-assets.developer.apple.com/published/d18ccebb3a51a66f6c6151bc1414d9a1/apple-pencil-preview-small%402x.png","line":47,"embedded":true},{"title":"An X in a circle to indicate incorrect usage.","target":"https://docs-assets.developer.apple.com/published/209f6f0fc8ad99d9bf59e12d82d06584/crossout%402x.png","line":49,"embedded":true},{"title":"An illustration of Apple Pencil hovering slightly above a gray rectangle that represents the screen. A medium blue oval beneath the tip represents a preview.","target":"https://docs-assets.developer.apple.com/published/4c5b24f4381fc1ed83af48f2a7ae3268/apple-pencil-preview-medium%402x.png","line":51,"embedded":true},{"title":"A checkmark in a circle to indicate correct usage.","target":"https://docs-assets.developer.apple.com/published/88662da92338267bb64cd2275c84e484/checkmark%402x.png","line":53,"embedded":true},{"title":"An illustration of Apple Pencil hovering slightly above a gray rectangle that represents the screen. A large blue oval beneath the tip represents a preview.","target":"https://docs-assets.developer.apple.com/published/50d3aa8162579aced9bd752b856b5f6b/apple-pencil-preview-large%402x.png","line":55,"embedded":true},{"title":"An X in a circle to indicate incorrect usage.","target":"https://docs-assets.developer.apple.com/published/209f6f0fc8ad99d9bf59e12d82d06584/crossout%402x.png","line":57,"embedded":true},{"title":"squeeze","target":"https://developer.apple.com/design/human-interface-guidelines/apple-pencil-and-scribble#Squeeze","line":59},{"title":"Adopting hover support for Apple Pencil","target":"https://developer.apple.com/documentation/UIKit/adopting-hover-support-for-apple-pencil","line":61},{"title":"Double tap","target":"https://developer.apple.com/design/human-interface-guidelines/apple-pencil-and-scribble#Double-tap","line":63},{"title":"Squeeze","target":"https://developer.apple.com/design/human-interface-guidelines/apple-pencil-and-scribble#Squeeze","line":71},{"title":"App Shortcut","target":"https://developer.apple.com/design/human-interface-guidelines/app-shortcuts","line":73},{"title":"Barrel roll","target":"https://developer.apple.com/design/human-interface-guidelines/apple-pencil-and-scribble#Barrel-roll","line":85},{"title":"Scribble","target":"https://developer.apple.com/design/human-interface-guidelines/apple-pencil-and-scribble#Scribble","line":91},{"title":"`UIIndirectScribbleInteraction`","target":"https://developer.apple.com/documentation/UIKit/UIIndirectScribbleInteraction-1nfjm","line":97},{"title":"`UIScribbleInteraction`","target":"https://developer.apple.com/documentation/UIKit/UIScribbleInteraction","line":105},{"title":"An illustration showing a stack of two text fields, where the top field is about half the width of the bottom field. Both text fields contain the word Name in the leading end, followed by a person's signature. The top text field is too narrow to fit all of the signature and is marked with an X in a circle to indicate incorrect usage. The bottom text field is wide enough to fit the full signature and is marked with a checkmark in a circle to indicate correct usage.","target":"https://docs-assets.developer.apple.com/published/0e2cd3f5562569097b9f668253dac0f7/apple-pencil-scribble%402x.png","line":107,"embedded":true},{"title":"Custom drawing","target":"https://developer.apple.com/design/human-interface-guidelines/apple-pencil-and-scribble#Custom-drawing","line":109},{"title":"PencilKit","target":"https://developer.apple.com/documentation/PencilKit","line":111},{"title":"Undo and redo","target":"https://developer.apple.com/design/human-interface-guidelines/undo-and-redo","line":115},{"title":"An illustration of an iPad screen in landscape on the left and an iPhone screen in portrait on the right. Both screens show the tool picker at the bottom edge of the screen. The iPad screen shows the standard undo and redo buttons in the left end of the tool picker, and the iPhone screen shows the undo button in the top toolbar.","target":"https://docs-assets.developer.apple.com/published/7587fbeb4272d990e295d093f79e1ef8/apple-pencil-undo-redo-buttons%402x.png","line":117,"embedded":true},{"title":"Platform considerations","target":"https://developer.apple.com/design/human-interface-guidelines/apple-pencil-and-scribble#Platform-considerations","line":119},{"title":"Resources","target":"https://developer.apple.com/design/human-interface-guidelines/apple-pencil-and-scribble#Resources","line":123},{"title":"Related","target":"https://developer.apple.com/design/human-interface-guidelines/apple-pencil-and-scribble#Related","line":125},{"title":"Entering data","target":"https://developer.apple.com/design/human-interface-guidelines/entering-data","line":127},{"title":"Developer documentation","target":"https://developer.apple.com/design/human-interface-guidelines/apple-pencil-and-scribble#Developer-documentation","line":129},{"title":"PencilKit","target":"https://developer.apple.com/documentation/PencilKit","line":131},{"title":"PaperKit","target":"https://developer.apple.com/documentation/PaperKit","line":133},{"title":"Videos","target":"https://developer.apple.com/design/human-interface-guidelines/apple-pencil-and-scribble#Videos","line":135},{"title":"![","target":"https://devimages-cdn.apple.com/wwdc-services/images/3055294D-836B-4513-B7B0-0BC5666246B0/BE1C66C1-9D8C-4EF7-BE9A-A36251A00B86/10006_wide_250x141_1x.jpg","line":137},{"title":"![","target":"https://devimages-cdn.apple.com/wwdc-services/images/C03E6E6D-A32A-41D0-9E50-C3C6059820AA/2104DC8F-01CE-453F-AF0E-A499CB193E97/9354_wide_250x141_1x.jpg","line":139},{"title":"Change log","target":"https://developer.apple.com/design/human-interface-guidelines/apple-pencil-and-scribble#Change-log","line":141}],"task_lines":[],"tasks":{},"codeblock_ranges":[],"key":"ai stuff/antigravity-awesome-skills-main/plugins/antigravity-awesome-skills/skills/hig-inputs/references/apple-pencil-and-scribble.md"},
